00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,880
People say you can't find someone who completely matches you.

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:10,720
I believe that's true, because no one in this world matches another person in every way.

3
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:16,300
We learn to accept our differences and grow together despite them.

4
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:23,060
A relationship grows stronger when two people accept each other's flaws and choose to love

5
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,000
one another anyway.
